# 📦 Open Source Software License Summary

This document provides a summary of the licenses for the main open-source libraries and AI models reviewed and utilized in this project. 

---

## 1. LLM Inference Engines & ML Frameworks

| Project Name | Official Repository / Source | License Type |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Qwen (Model)** | [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/Qwen) | **Apache 2.0** / **Custom** |
| **Candle** | [GitHub](https://github.com/huggingface/candle) | **MIT** / **Apache 2.0** |
| **mistral.rs** | [GitHub](https://github.com/ericlbuehler/mistral.rs) | **MIT** |
| **aha** | [GitHub](https://github.com/jhqxxx/aha) | **Apache 2.0** |

